  "title": "Mr. C NDE",
  "date": "2025-03-04T00:16:06.000Z",
  "content": "In October 2022, I fell into a coma due to long-term insomnia.<br><br> I had a serious insomnia problem. But, I ignored this condition at the time and did not sleep at all until the last week. I quickly called an ambulance, but then I passed out. It was 7 o'clock in the morning at my residence in Tokyo, Japan. <br><br> In the last moment I was awake, I felt the world was spinning and my heart was uncomfortable. I had difficulty breathing and there were stars in front of my eyes. After I fainted, I only felt that those feelings were moving away from me.<br><br> I thought at the time; I was afraid I was going to die. Then I seemed to see the figure of my father, but my father had passed away more than ten years ago. I still hear his voice. I didn't say anything, but I wondered in my mind if I had to go. But it was like a consciousness came to me and said strongly, 'No, you can't leave because you have unfinished work.' I woke up later in the hospital emergency room. <br><br> The impact of this incident on me is that I no longer let some diseases go unchecked. I was originally a very nihilistic person. Later, after this experience, I understood the value of my existence; because after all that time, I was told by that consciousness that I couldn't leave. <br><br><span class=\"m108",
